                        "email": "ifelmail@gmail.com",
                        "username": "ifel"
                    },
                    "message": "It can also accept `${valid_status_codes}=[${HTTP_BAD_REQUEST}]`, so you will be able to create the subscription here in the block:\n```\nRedfish.Post  /redfish/v1/EventService/Subscriptions  body=&{payload}\n    ...  valid_status_codes=${valid_status_codes}\n```\n\nAnd don't call Redfish.Post all the times in the test itself."
